=== hk-12-ring-self-move-indexes
from: Array::Agnostic 0.0.18 lib/Array/Agnostic.rakumod:144
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: self method call as a statement inside a method
--- code
my class Ring {
    has @!items = <a b c>;
    method move-indexes-down($n) { @!items.push(@!items.shift) for ^$n }
    method step { self.move-indexes-down(1); @!items }
}
say Ring.new.step
--- expect
[b c a]
